        "TileImage": "$($repository 4e3a4188-aa48-4bfd-8f03-4ae4b693ba69).Image",
        "Description": "Targets: Hector Delgado, Sheikh Salman Al-Ghazali\rGood day, Agent 47. Your targets within the contracts series are severely involved with the black market. Our customer doesn&apos;t want that particular black market to be further more dominating so they asked us to terminate a couple of black deals within the worldwide market of black. \rYour targets had been so far tracked which should give you the edge in your operation. Be wary that it has to be done in extreme silence with no witnesses though.",
